message: "If you use this software or these datasets, please cite the following."
title: "Misranked by Small Samples: code, datasets and result logs"
abstract: >-
  Code, processed finite-element datasets, and complete per-seed result logs
  for a study showing that architecture comparisons in physics-informed neural
  operator learning can misrank mechanisms at the sample sizes nonlinear
  finite-element analysis realistically supplies.
